---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy policy for Vitteey Sarthi Color Studio. No accounts, no server-side storage of your palettes — saved palettes live in your browser's local storage only."
>
  <h1 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold text-text">Privacy Policy</h1>
  <div class="max-w-2xl space-y-4 text-text-muted">
    <p>
      Vitteey Sarthi Color Studio, a product of Vitteey Sarthi LLP, does not require an account
      and does not operate a backend server or database for your palette data.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong class="text-text">Saved palettes:</strong> When you save a palette, it is stored only in your browser's
      local storage on your own device. It is never transmitted to us and is not accessible from
      other devices or browsers.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong class="text-text">Shared links:</strong> The "Copy Share Link" feature encodes your palette directly
      into the URL itself — nothing is uploaded or stored on a server to generate a share link.
    </p>
    <p>
      <strong class="text-text">Analytics and cookies:</strong> This site does not set tracking cookies. If analytics
      are added in the future, this page will be updated to describe what is collected.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this policy, please reach out via the contact details on our
      GitHub repository.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
